meta {
  name: Read the loan history
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/books/{{bookId}}/history?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  200. Every loan ever made of this book, in every state, newest first.

  Returned and cancelled loans are included by default and there is no way to exclude them
  wholesale - only to narrow to one state with status=Active|Returned|Cancelled. A history
  endpoint that quietly omitted the terminal states would perform, one query at a time,
  exactly the deletion this API refuses to perform.
}
